OL,3,GNEWSASearch goes on to get oldest pub
OL,4,Aback on tap
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrinkers looking to quench their thirst
OL,7,Fat Northampton's oldest pub must wait a
OL,8,Fwhile as the hunt for a new operator
OL,9,Fcontinues following a #3.5m renovation.
OL,11,FThe Grade II listed Old Black Lion on
OL,12,FMarefair in Northampton dates back to
OL,13,Fthe 16th Century but has not welcomed
OL,14,Fpatrons since 2018.
OL,16,FWest Northamptonshire Council and the
OL,17,FChurches Conservation Trust (CCT)
OL,18,Fstarted work on its revival three years
OL,19,Fago, with the trust having already
OL,20,Fmoved its national office into the
OL,21,Fbuilding last year.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
