OL,3,GNEWSASearch goes on to get oldest pub
OL,4,Aback on tap
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We're very aware that we're looking
OL,7,Ffor a pub operator at a very difficult
OL,8,Ftime for the hospitality industry,"
OL,9,Fsaid Matt Storey, head of initiatives
OL,10,Fand partnerships at CCT.
